ding:`Inasubiri`,Confirmed:`Imethibitishwa`,Preparing:`Inaandaliwa`,"Ready for pickup":`Tayari kuchukuliwa`,"Ready for delivery":`Tayari kupelekwa`,"Out for delivery":`Iko njiani`,Delivered:`Imefikishwa`,Collected:`Imechukuliwa`,Rejected:`Imekataliwa`,Cancelled:`Imeghairiwa`,Payments:`Malipo`,"Retry payments":`Pakia malipo tena`,"Loading payments…":`Inapakia malipo…`,Paid:`Imelipwa`,"Balance due":`Salio linalodaiwa`,"Refund owed to you":`Pesa unazodai kurejeshewa`,Refunded:`Imerejeshwa`,"No payments yet. Pay the shop in cash or by mobile money once your order is confirmed; you will get a receipt here.":`Bado hakuna malipo. Lipa duka kwa pesa taslimu au kwa simu baada ya oda kuthibitishwa; utapata risiti hapa.`,cancelled:`imefutwa`,"View receipt":`Tazama risiti`,Unpaid:`Haijalipwa`,"Part paid":`Imelipwa sehemu`,"Refund due":`Inadai kurejeshewa`,"Partly refunded":`Imerejeshwa sehemu`,Cash:`Pesa taslimu`,"Mobile money":`Pesa kwa simu`,Back:`Rudi`,"Print or save as PDF":`Chapisha au hifadhi kama PDF`,"Receipt {number}":`Risiti {number}`,"Payment receipt":`Risiti ya malipo`,"Cancelled — this receipt was recorded in error and no longer counts.":`Imefutwa — risiti hii iliandikwa kimakosa na haihesabiki tena.`,"Receipt number":`Namba ya risiti`,Date:`Tarehe`,Order:`Oda`,Customer:`Mteja`,"Paid by":`Imelipwa kwa`,"Received by":`Imepokelewa na`,"Amount received":`Kiasi kilichopokelewa`,"Order total":`Jumla ya oda`,"Paid so far":`Kilicholipwa hadi sasa`,"Payment acknowledgement from Tarime Hardware. This is not a TRA fiscal (EFD) receipt. Balances are as at printing.":`Uthibitisho wa malipo kutoka Tarime Hardware. Hii si risiti ya kodi ya TRA (EFD). Salio ni la wakati wa kuchapisha.`,"3D views and effects: On":`Mionekano na madoido ya 3D: Imewashwa`,"3D views and effects: Off":`Mionekano na madoido ya 3D: Imezimwa`,"CLIENT PREVIEW":`TOLEO LA MAJARIBIO`,"Sample data · No real sign-in, orders or payments":`Data ya mfano · Hakuna kuingia, oda wala malipo halisi`,Storefront:`Duka`,